{"observed_at": "2026-11-06T03:01:03.848546+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G02", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "영어공부하는 법 알려줘.", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "영어공부는 **목표를 하나 정하고, 매일 짧게 듣고 직접 써보는 것**부터 시작하세요. 회화가 목표라면 말하기에, 시험이 목표라면 시험 유형 연습에 시간을 더 배분하는 게 좋습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115?utm_source=openai))\n\n**하루 30분 예시**\n1. **10분 듣기:** 내 수준에 맞는 짧은 영상이나 음성을 듣고, 들린 문장을 따라 말하기.\n2. **10분 표현 익히기:** 단어만 외우지 말고 문장으로 익힌 뒤, 며칠 간격으로 뜻을 떠올려 보기. 간격을 둔 복습과 기억해 내는 연습은 어휘 학습에 도움이 됩니다. ([cambridge.org](https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A?utm_source=openai))\n3. **10분 말하거나 쓰기:** 오늘 한 일을 영어로 3문장 말하고 녹음하거나 일기로 쓰기. 녹음을 다시 들으면 고칠 표현과 발음을 찾기 좋습니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n\n처음부터 완벽하게 하려 하기보다 **2주 동안 꾸준히 할 수 있는 양**으로 시작해 보세요. 회화·시험·업무 중 어떤 목적이고 현재 어느 정도 수준인지 알려주시면 더 맞춰서 계획을 짜드릴게요.", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 211, "start_index": 102, "title": "Planning your English learning | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 613, "start_index": 379, "title": "A REVIEW OF LABORATORY STUDIES OF ADULT SECOND LANGUAGE VOCABULARY TRAINING | Studies in Second Language Acquisition | Cambridge Core", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/studies-in-second-language-acquisition/article/abs/review-of-laboratory-studies-of-adult-second-language-vocabulary-training/18F0A5D1FFC829CE05931B2EEE83124A?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 878, "start_index": 699, "title": "Five tips for busy learners: listening and speaking | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8723, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 13, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 407, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 79}, "total_tokens": 9130}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_08d792e1e438fce9016aed42f297bc87d29d20c04a2634ae2c", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:cambridge.org language learning spaced repetition retrieval practice vocabulary study", "site:britishcouncil.org learn english tips listening speaking daily practice"], "query": "site:cambridge.org language learning spaced repetition retrieval practice vocabulary study", "sources": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/reading/a2/study-skills-tips"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/level/improve-your-english-level/how-improve-your-english-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/206115"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/learning-hub"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/how-get-your-english-b1-level"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/comment/201591"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/how-be-confident-learner"}, {"type": "url", "url": 